{"kind":"overview","hierarchy":{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","paths":[]},"sections":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Discovering a new framework can be exciting and scary. Learn how you can embed and use OUDS Swift Package."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"With this tutorial you will learn fundamental concepts of Orange Unified Design System and discover the layers of this framework."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Theme, components, tokens… everything will be introduced!"}]}],"image":"ic_unified_ds.png","kind":"hero","title":"Swift Package Discovery Tutorial","action":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies","type":"reference","isActive":true,"overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}],"overridingTitle":"Get started"},"backgroundImage":"ic_unified_ds.png"},{"image":null,"kind":"volume","content":[],"chapters":[{"tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies"],"name":"Import of the Swift Package and choose its librairies","image":"ic_unified_ds.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In this chapter you will learn how to import the OUDS iOS Swift Package and which librairies it provides","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"you should choose for your needs.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme"],"name":"Preparation of the theme","image":"ic_theme_intro.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this chapter you will see how to instanciate a theme and inject it inside your app"}]}]},{"tutorials":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components"],"n